Compatibility and attribution notes:

- `lrcalc-rs` is intended to provide a drop-in `liblrcalc` ABI and command-line
  surface compatible with Anders S. Buch's Littlewood-Richardson Calculator.
- The original Littlewood-Richardson Calculator is:

    Copyright (C) 1999- Anders S. Buch

  and is distributed under the GNU General Public License, either version 3 or
  any later version.
- Portions of this project port, mirror, or are derived from algorithms and ABI
  behavior in the original Littlewood-Richardson Calculator. Those portions
  remain under GPL-3.0-or-later.

The full GPL version 3 text is in `COPYING`.
